--     shifted to <= 14:35 so no row lies in the future of the doctor timeline.
--   * Statuses 'issued' are meant to be dispensed by 40_; 'dispensed' / 'partly_dispensed' / 'cancelled' rows are history (no dispensing rows).
--   * NEWS2 (migration 122) differs from the prototype's partial formula: computed scores can differ by 1-2 from the screens; the board
